il (about 5 minutes)","url":"https:\/\/www.espressomykitchen.com\/easy-restaurant-style-salsa\/#wprm-recipe-2784-step-0-0"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Then set aside to cool down for a couple minutes.","name":"Then set aside to cool down for a couple minutes.","url":"https:\/\/www.espressomykitchen.com\/easy-restaurant-style-salsa\/#wprm-recipe-2784-step-0-1"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"In a food processor or blender add cilantro, onion, salt, oregano and the pan-roasted ingredients","name":"In a food processor or blender add cilantro, onion, salt, oregano and the pan-roasted ingredients","url":"https:\/\/www.espressomykitchen.com\/easy-restaurant-style-salsa\/#wprm-recipe-2784-step-0-2"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Blend until smooth. Add 1\/4 cup of water if consistency is too thick.","name":"Blend until smooth. Add 1\/4 cup of water if consistency is too thick.","url":"https:\/\/www.espressomykitchen.com\/easy-restaurant-style-salsa\/#wprm-recipe-2784-step-0-3"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Ready to serve","name":"Ready to serve","url":"https:\/\/www.espressomykitchen.com\/easy-restaurant-style-salsa\/#wprm-recipe-2784-step-0-4"}],"recipeCategory":["Salsas"],"recipeCuisine":["Mexican"],"keywords":"Easy restaurant style salsa","nutrition":{"@type":"NutritionInformation","calories":"350 kcal","servingSize":"1 serving"},"@id":"https:\/\/www.espressomykitchen.com\/easy-restaurant-style-salsa\/#recipe","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/www.espressomykitchen.com\/easy-restaurant-style-salsa\/#article"},"mainEntityOfPage":"https:\/\/www.espressomykitchen.com\/easy-restaurant-style-salsa\/"}]}</script>
